' The doctor's words after HEAL at the cap (`UpdateDoctorText`; `preset
' classic ai none seed 3 start 0 health 80`). 80 + 36 stops at the cap of
' 95; the gain worked out again after the treatment, with the offer still on
' the table, is 0: "burn?522", not the "<= 95" line 510.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 245,231         ' the doctor
wait 150
sceneclick 52,119        ' the meat onto the table
treat                    ' 80 -> 95
wait 3
snap doc_cap
esc
quit
